        },
        "body": "- Added `FilePickerSettings` to support platform-specific configuration.\r\n- Enhanced file picker API to allow customization of dialog titles, initial directories, and other properties.\r\n- Introduced desktop-specific parent window handling via `ProvideFilePickerParentWindow` and `FrameWindowScope.rememberFilePickerLauncher`.\r\n- Refactored sample screens to showcase new functionality.\r\n- Updated documentation with usage examples and setup guides.\r\n\r\nCloses: #114 #255 ",
